e 1 first. Run RED on JVM + Node, save logs to collab/yang-clojure/<new-ts>-floatkind-evidence/.\n2. Shared factory FIRST: shared numeric-token classifier + carrier constructor under yang.core shared layer (one implementation; per-language lexeme dialect tables) — ts/php/python adapters move to it (their existing correct boxing is a control — don't rewrite beyond the adapter call).\n3. Clojure ingestion stage (lexical-coverage demonstration BEFORE selecting minimal mechanism).\n4. Carrier admission + execution reboxing.\n5. GREEN: all seven gates on JVM + Node; then Dart + Jolt legs per gate 6 cross-host matrix.\n6. Migration per RULING 3: revision + profile, legacy custody tests, docs per RULING 4.\n7. Re-pin per RULING 5 protocol.\nDeliverable: findings file. Commit NOTHING.\n\nThis is a huge amount of work. Let me be strategic and prioritize doing real, verifiable work within this session. Let me first explore the codebase to understand the structure.\n\nKey files to look at:\n- src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc (read-forms at 2135, compile-literal at 766, literal?/constant-form? 270-301, \"Cannot compile unknown form type\" 1840)\n- src/cljc/yin/repl.cljc (read-forms at 1333)\n- src/cljc/yin/repl/frontends.cljc (135: standard clojure binding :input :forms, :parse identity; 44-61: manifest revision c1-2, profile :yang.clojure/constructed-collections-v1)\n- src/cljc/yang/typescript/antlr/lower.cljc:428-440 (precedent)\n- src/cljc/yang/python/antlr/lower.cljc:350-363\n- src/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:310-315\n- src/cljc/yin/vm/data.cljc (513-536 equiv, 538 admit-key?)\n- src/cljc/dao/host/integer.cljc:66\n- src/cljc/dao/jing/cbor.cljc (201-220, 242, 748)\n- src/cljc/yang/clojure/core_impl.cljc:256-261 (inc/dec dispatch)\n- src/cljc/yang/clojure/prelude.cljc:225 (clj/collection-key)\n- test/yang/clojure_collection_order_test.cljc (corpus)\n- test/yang/clojure_callsite_test.cljc\n- test/yang/clojure/stream_eval_test.cljc\n- test/yin/vm/data_test.cljc, float_test.cljc\n-