{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_66d8d90d3ad1487d8993aafd","type":"tool_result","content":"{:tasks\n {gen:antlr\n  {:doc \"Generate the pinned grammars-v4 parsers for every target (antlr/*/manifest.edn): Java compiled into build/antlr/<g>/classes, JavaScript in build/antlr/<g>/js, Dart in lib/antlr/<g>; filters after --: --grammar g --target t\"\n   :task (apply shell \"bb\" \"src/dev/build_cache.clj\"\n                \"antlr\" *command-line-args*)}\n\n  autobahn:jolt\n  {:doc \"J6f Autobahn conformance: starts the testee and the Dockerized pinned suite, waits for the READY barrier, runs harness.py per role, collects results/, and shuts both sides down. Usage: bb autobahn:jolt <role> <agent>\"\n   :task (apply shell {:continue true} \"bash\" \"tools/jolt-autobahn/launch.sh\" *command-line-args*)}\n\n  deps:npm\n  {:doc \"Worktree-local npm ci, reused only while input and installed-file digests match\"\n   :task (shell \"bb\" \"src/dev/build_cache.clj\" \"npm\")}\n\n  ;; jolt host lane (experimental, docs/design/yin.repl-jolt-implementation.md)\n  bootstrap:jolt\n  {:doc \"Materialize the jolt-toolchain.edn pins into build/tools/jolt (mise Chez/CMake checked, jolt cloned at the full SHA, never pulled) and write build/tools/jolt-env.sh\"\n   :task (System/exit\n           (:exit (shell {:continue true} \"bb\" \"src/dev/jolt_bootstrap.clj\")))}\n\n  test:jolt-bootstrap-neg\n  {:doc \"Copy/revert the jolt clone under gitignored build/bootstrap-neg (deleted on success, retained on failure) and declare a synthetic patch and prove bootstrap refuses it unapplied or corrupted, then accepts it applied (JOLT_BOOTSTRAP_TEST_DIR selects the source clone)\"\n   :task (System/exit\n           (:exit (shell {:continue true} \"bb\" \"src/dev/jolt_bootstrap.clj\" \"--test-negative\")))}\n\n  smoke:jolt\n  {:doc \"J0a baseline smoke under jolt -Srepro -M:jolt: tracked load of yang.antlr.export/packet and defcfn :blocking calls (needs bb bootstra