{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_b1ae0b8a9f0443be827e4e7b","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t(ns yang.python.antlr.profiles\n2\t  \"Publication and admission of the two immutable Python frontend profiles.\"\n3\t  (:require [dao.jing :as jing]\n4\t            [dao.jing.mem :as mem]\n5\t            [yang.clojure.core-impl :as impl]\n6\t            [yang.clojure.core-module :as library]\n7\t            [yang.clojure.prelude :as clj]\n8\t            [yang.core.call :as call]\n9\t            [yang.core.prelude-admission :as admission]\n10\t            [yang.core.semantics :as semantics]\n11\t            [yang.python.antlr.clj-runtime :as runtime]\n12\t            [yang.python.antlr.contract :as contract]\n13\t            [yang.python.antlr.prelude :as py]\n14\t            [yang.rt.effect :as effect]\n15\t            [yang.rt.int :as int-rt]\n16\t            [yin.vm :as vm]\n17\t            [yin.vm.data :as data]\n18\t            [yin.vm.integer :as integer]\n19\t            [yin.vm.linker.publish :as publish]\n20\t            [yin.vm.module :as module]))\n21\t\n22\t\n23\t(def ^:private integer-limits {::integer/max-bits 100000 ::integer/max-digits 4300})\n24\t(def ^:private max-items 1048576)\n25\t\n26\t\n27\t(defn registry\n28\t  ([] (registry integer-limits))\n29\t  ([limits]\n30\t   (-> (module/default-registry)\n31\t       module/register-cell-module\n32\t       (data/register-data-module {::data/max-items max-items})\n33\t       (py/register-integer-module limits)\n34\t       clj/admit)))\n35\t\n36\t\n37\t(def ^:private profile-modules\n38\t  {contract/legacy-id '[yang.call py]\n39\t   contract/clojure-id '[yang.call yrt.effect yrt.int clj clojure.core.impl clojure.core clj.py]})\n40\t\n41\t\n42\t;; Immutable publication identities for these revisions. The manifest\n43\t;; footprint, exports, profiles and tree are re-derived from the emitters.\n44\t(def ^:private module-locks\n45\t  '{clj {:address :segment/blake3-78903e4442bf