{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_163d9b9839904a5f897f89aa","type":"tool_result","content":"(ns yang.core.uast\n  \"Universal AST constructors shared by every language lowering and prelude. Every\n   function returns a canonical map node (`:literal`, `:variable`, `:lambda`,\n   `:application`, `:if`, `:vm/current-continuation`); nothing here adds a\n   node type.\n\n   `sexp->uast` reads a small s-expression notation into those same nodes so\n   the prelude can be written legibly:\n\n     symbol            -> :variable\n     (fn [params] b)   -> :lambda\n     (if t c a)        -> :if\n     (do a b ... z)    -> sequencing through one-parameter lambdas\n     (let [x v ...] b) -> nested immediately applied lambdas\n     (quote x)         -> :literal x\n     (%capture)        -> :vm/current-continuation\n     (yin/def k v)     -> the definition application\n     (f a ...)         -> :application\n     any other value   -> :literal\"\n  (:require\n    [yang.tails :as tails]\n    [yin.vm :as vm]))\n\n\n(defn lit\n  [x]\n  {:type :literal, :value x})\n\n\n(defn v\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/prelude.cljc:6:  (:require","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"519cc353-4ebf-4ee9-a727-f6a51287dd1a","uuid":"3a88cfd5-b2a0-4ad8-9e8e-f2f78eaeb85d","timestamp":"2026-11-26T12:37:20.317Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"(ns yang.core.uast\n  \"Universal AST constructors shared by every language lowering and prelude. Every\n   function returns a canonical map node (`:literal`, `:variable`, `:lambda`,\n   `:application`, `:if`, `:vm/current-continuation`); nothing here adds a\n   node type.\n\n   `sexp->uast` reads a small s-expression notation into those same nodes so\n   the prelude can be written legibly:\n\n     symbol            -> :variable\n     (fn [params] b)   -> :lambda\n     (if t c a)        -> :if\n     (do a b ... z)    -> sequencing through one-parameter lambdas\n     (let [x v ...] b) -> nested immediately applied lambdas\n     (quote x)         -> :literal x\n     (%capture)        -> :vm/current-continuation\n     (yin/def k v)     -> the definition application\n     (f a ...)         -> :application\n     any other value   -> :literal\"\n  (:require\n    [yang.tails :as tails]\n    [yin.vm :as vm]))\n\n\n(defn lit\n  [x]\n  {:type :literal, :value x})\n\n\n(defn v\nsrc/cljc/yang/core/prelude.cljc:6:  (:require","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_163d9b9839904a5f897f89aa","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"subcommandResults"}}]}
