{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20261126205329d6e4570e997542f0","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I made errors in that sed-like surgery (dropped a `)` in the last replace producing unbalanced forms, and the (when ...) wrapping needs correct closers). This piecemeal string surgery is error-prone. Better: rewrite the WHOLE file cleanly in one heredoc now that the design is settled. The file so far: ns + helpers + gate1 + gate2 + gate4. I'll rewrite it completely and carefully, then append gates 5-7 in a second write. Balance parens by construction.","signature":"271ff80f02a546e98742ea24"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"519cc353-4ebf-4ee9-a727-f6a51287dd1a","uuid":"dd965ded-5498-418e-b9eb-fcd67cdc67e6","timestamp":"2026-11-26T12:53:34.346Z","thinking_duration_ms":2406,"thinking_display":"updates"}
